'''Icicles '''is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2018 Christmas box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2018|2018 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

==Appearance==
Its blade is icy blue in color and resembles a chunk of ice. The guard is solid white, and the handle is solid black with some icicles seen on it, hence the name.

==Trivia==
*It has a [[Icicles (Gun)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Icicles_Set Icicles Set].
*Its decal, published by [[didi1147]] on December 18, 2018, can be found [https://www.roblox.com/library/2659488220/Icecicals-knife here].

